State machine
=============

      entry:
        transport ssh    -> state_login_ssh
    
      state_login_ssh
          at prompt          -> send screen-length disable -> show
      show
          at prompt          -> send display current-configuration -> capture
      capture
          at prompt          -> capture_stop           -> logout
          (capture_start on entry)
      logout
          (send)             -> send quit              -> done

